{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S05的静态感受词偏密，短时间内扫读压力较大；S12的“让对方安心”也替人物补了一层动机，不如Y克制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的关键词放大加亮，让我不必读完每句话就能抓住人物当下的心理转折；感受词分层、部分随音乐出现，也让我能一边听一边接收信息，而不是同时面对一整列词语。更重要的是，X把人物从试探、放松、害怕失去到愿意接受自己的感情这一过程串得更清楚，水面、摇荡、船体等意象又与具体的声音变化相互呼应，情绪不只是笼统地说甜蜜、悲伤，而有了身体感和时间感。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "df024334-3cc2-4165-a5aa-e08073ff59ef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231704553473Z", "elapsed_seconds": 86.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:18:30.858089+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "38209b626b706e230c7a42652b3b8a1adee096813713f757c355e2e77859e321", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach